    "updated_at": "2022-08-04T18:42:48Z",
    "body": "This might be a general IME problem that shouldn't depend on page authors opting into the fix on a form-by-form basis.\r\n\r\nPerhaps when IMEs that care about the enter key are in effect, a single enter press on a text input should just _always_ bring up an IME interface instead of submitting. Is there a central place to specify/recommend IME behavior like that?",
