    "created_at": "2022-08-31T02:29:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-08-31T02:29:30Z",
    "body": "When native apps have issues with IME it is usually because they are not passing the key events to the IME to be processed before they do their own processing. Web apps should be able to do the same. It is not a good solution to just block enter key to submit; the correct behavior should be to end the active IME session with the enter key and enter to submit on the subsequent one. IMHO. ",
